      },
      "meaning": "to take something for a short time and give it back",
      "example": "Can I borrow your eraser?",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "क्या मैं तुम्हारा रबड़ उधार ले सकता/सकती हूँ?",
        "hinglish": "Kya main tumhara rabad udhaar le sakta/sakti hoon?"
      }
    },
    {
