      },
      "meaning": "to give something to someone for a short time",
      "example": "Please lend me your ruler.",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "प्लीज़ मुझे अपना स्केल उधार दो।",
        "hinglish": "Please mujhe apna scale udhaar do."
      }
